+## What was done
+Added `importTasks(list, text)` to `src/index.ts`, with the parsing in `src/domain/import.ts`. Each
+non-blank line is `title;priority;tags`; every valid line is added through `list.add`, so the existing
+validation and duplicate rules apply. It returns `{ imported, rejected }`, `rejected` being
+`{ line, reason }` with `line` counting from 1 (blank lines count). Tests in `test/import.test.ts`.
